# PHASE-022 (T-P22-1a, recorded as a DR-P22 deviation): apps/mobile needs
# @types/react 18.3.x for the React Native 0.76 runtime while apps/web +
# packages/ui stay on React 19 types. With both versions in the store, pnpm's
# hidden hoist (.pnpm/node_modules) picked 18.3.31 (the alphabetically-first
# importer, apps/mobile), which flipped lucide-react's un-peer-declared
# React types to 18.x and broke `pnpm --filter @erp/ui typecheck`
# (ReactNode bigint mismatch). Fix: keep @types/react OUT of the hidden hoist
# and let the root devDependency pin (@types/react@19.3.0 — the pre-022
# hoisted version) serve the hoist-reliant consumers from the repo root,
# restoring the PHASE-021 resolution state exactly. apps/mobile resolves its
# own @types/react@18.3.31 from apps/mobile/node_modules; react-native and
# peers resolve theirs via explicit peer suffixes — both unaffected.
hoist-pattern[]=*
hoist-pattern[]=!@types/react
